	<section_number>55.1-1232</section_number>
	<catch_line>Use and occupancy by tenant</catch_line>
	<text>
		Unless otherwise agreed, the tenant shall occupy his dwelling unit only as a residence.
	</text>
	<history>1974, c. 680, § 55-248.19; 2000, c. 760; 2019, c. 712.</history>
